WEBVTT

00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:32.560
Well, then...

00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:35.680
Let's discuss this matter again next time.

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:36.620
Of course.

00:01:36.620 --> 00:01:40.650
Thank you, Prime Minister,
for taking the time to see me personally.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.410
That said,

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:46.190
it is reassuring to see
that you have such a talented son.

00:01:46.190 --> 00:01:47.080
Yes...

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:50.050
Now, if we can just get him married quickly,

00:01:50.050 --> 00:01:52.620
the Ascart household
will be even better off.

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:55.790
And on that note, there's someone
I'd like to introduce to you.

00:01:55.790 --> 00:01:59.210
I would be more than happy
to discuss that at another time.

00:02:00.810 --> 00:02:03.290
Was it really a good idea
to reject his offer?

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:06.060
I was just being diplomatic.
Don't worry about it.

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:10.060
But this is the third time
he's reached out to us,

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:12.060
and you do have your position to consider...

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:14.310
You don't need to worry about me.

00:02:14.310 --> 00:02:17.770
The most important thing in a marriage
is what the ones getting married want.

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:21.380
Raphael.

00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:22.670
Hello, Nicol.

00:02:26.320 --> 00:02:27.610
How's work going?

00:02:27.610 --> 00:02:29.450
The pressure is relentless.

00:02:29.450 --> 00:02:31.050
And not just with work.

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:34.080
Let me guess. This is about getting married?

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:35.210
How did you...

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:36.640
Of course I know.

00:02:36.640 --> 00:02:39.310
It comes up in conversation
among the nobility all the time.

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:43.130
Not only does the son of the Ascart
household not have a fiancée,

00:02:43.130 --> 00:02:46.310
but he hasn't even had an arranged
marriage meeting, they say.

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:52.680
Most nobles are betrothed around
the time they debut in high society.

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:55.450
I guess people like me are rare.

00:02:55.900 --> 00:03:00.010
Well, the issue of succession
is important to any household.

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:01.360
What does your father say?

00:03:01.630 --> 00:03:03.950
He's even more laid-back about it than I am.

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:06.050
He's never tried to rush me.

00:03:06.050 --> 00:03:08.830
He says what's important
is what the ones getting married want.

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:10.440
Really?

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:13.000
What a great father.

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:17.460
I don't know if I should make
a move myself for my family's sake...

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:22.080
I'm not in a position to carry
my household on my shoulders,

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:25.470
and I don't exactly know
what makes a happy marriage.

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:28.310
So I can't give any good advice, but...

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:32.410
Just don't lie to yourself.

00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:41.390
Don't lie to myself, huh?

00:03:41.390 --> 00:03:44.190
If that's what it takes,
I guess I'll be alone forever.

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:49.420
Back then, I never would have
dreamed I'd become so drawn to her.

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:51.620
The more I saw her,

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:53.150
the more I fell.

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:56.410
But she has a fiancé.

00:03:56.830 --> 00:03:59.130
One who's been my friend
since childhood, no less.

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:08.510
I have to give up on her

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:11.550
and start walking a new path.

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:14.810
You want an arranged marriage meeting?

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:16.100
And, um...

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:18.100
Are you sure you want to
go through with this?

00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:20.570
Yes. Please take care of it.

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:21.780
All right.

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:24.160
But as for Sophia...

00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:27.010
Yes, I'm sure it'll be a shock to her.

00:04:27.010 --> 00:04:30.190
I'll try to think about how
to break it to her.

00:04:30.190 --> 00:04:31.870
Don't tell her yourself.

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:32.840
All right.

00:04:36.110 --> 00:04:39.800
Frey, shouldn't your carriage be here soon?

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:41.620
Yes, it should.

00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:45.150
I wish my father would just
give up on this idea already.

00:04:45.150 --> 00:04:47.760
I have no interest in doing this at all.

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:50.350
It's really a problem unique
to noble ladies, isn't it?

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:53.640
Frey, Ginger, can I help out with anything?

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:55.150
Thank you for offering.

00:04:55.150 --> 00:04:58.350
But there's no need.
This is our job, after all.

00:04:58.350 --> 00:04:59.350
Really?

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:03.980
Okay, I'll take this trash out, then.

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:08.440
Lady Catarina is always so kind.

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:11.870
And you're as cold as ever.

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:14.560
I'm just acting like I always do.

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:27.000
You do it this way!

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:29.900
Oh! I get it!

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:33.520
Ginger does it again!
Top of the first-year class!

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:36.010
I didn't do anything
worth being praised for.

00:05:36.010 --> 00:05:38.890
It's just that you'd been moaning
and groaning for so long,

00:05:38.890 --> 00:05:41.280
and I wanted you to be a little quieter.

00:05:42.350 --> 00:05:43.730
Oh, okay!

00:05:43.930 --> 00:05:47.320
Lady Catarina, would you like
to take a break with us over here?

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:48.700
We have sweets.

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:50.920
Oh, thank you!

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:53.930
They look so good!

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:53.930
Catarina Claes...

00:05:53.930 --> 00:05:55.700
Even though she's the daughter of a duke

00:05:53.930 --> 00:05:55.710
Which one should I have?

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:58.700
and the fiancée of Prince Geordo,

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:01.640
she interacts with people of lower
status without discrimination,

00:06:01.640 --> 00:06:03.290
and everyone loves her.

00:06:03.470 --> 00:06:04.510
But...

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:11.980
Lady Catarina,

00:06:11.980 --> 00:06:14.270
why are you doing such things,
and dressed like that?

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:18.770
Here, try it.

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:25.990
It's good...

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:27.170
Isn't it?

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:30.540
She's really just a strange, silly person.

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:33.180
Her magical and academic abilities
aren't even that special,

00:06:33.180 --> 00:06:36.030
yet she's been invited to work
at the Department of Magic.

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:40.570
I suppose, for a high-ranking noble,
that might be possible.

00:06:41.030 --> 00:06:45.210
Either way, she's nothing like me,
someone who's always had to

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:47.620
make my own way in life.

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:49.910
I should avoid getting involved with her...

00:06:49.910 --> 00:06:51.090
Ginger!

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:54.440
Want some of these sweets?
They're really good!

00:06:54.440 --> 00:06:56.840
No, thank you. I'm working.

00:06:56.840 --> 00:06:59.350
Really? Okay, you can eat them later, then!

00:07:01.510 --> 00:07:04.040
Why does she bother with me?

00:07:14.510 --> 00:07:16.040
Look.

00:07:16.340 --> 00:07:19.410
These are all the marriage
offers you've received.

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:22.490
Goodness, you certainly are popular.

00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:25.260
It won't be easy to
narrow down the candidates.

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:31.130
Um...

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:32.550
Y-Yes?!

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:34.640
Shall we talk about something?

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:36.100
Okay...

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:45.320
Oh, no. What am I supposed to talk about?

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:47.180
When I'm with Catarina,

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:49.900
we can enjoy talking
about the most trivial things.

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:55.160
Just looking at those sparkling
eyes makes me feel happy.

00:07:56.430 --> 00:07:57.630
No!

00:07:57.630 --> 00:08:00.640
I need to properly face
the lady in front of me now!

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:10.760
Are you, perhaps, feeling ill?

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:12.280
Do you have a fever?

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:21.640
We received a letter
from the lady you met the other day.

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:26.290
It seems she feels too embarrassed
to meet with you again.

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:27.480
Did something happen?

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:29.220
No, nothing.

00:08:30.080 --> 00:08:33.950
Oh, well. Let's move
on to the next candidate.

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:39.160
And the dance that the young son shared
with his fiancée was so lovely!

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:42.990
Of course, even after the wedding,
they still get along beautifully!

00:08:43.230 --> 00:08:44.320
I see.

00:08:44.990 --> 00:08:46.240
Right...

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:49.710
When attending a ball,
most people focus on the dancing.

00:08:50.070 --> 00:08:51.840
If this was Catarina...

00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:55.170
She'd be talking about what food
they served and how good it was,

00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:57.630
or how amazing that dessert was.

00:08:57.950 --> 00:09:00.470
Almost all she talks about is food.

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:06.320
Everything about her gives
the impression of a noble lady.

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:08.600
She's so different from Catarina.

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:13.240
Catarina thinks nothing of shoving
her beautiful hair under a kerchief,

00:09:13.640 --> 00:09:17.040
and her hands are a bit rough
from swinging a hoe around.

00:09:17.400 --> 00:09:21.080
Yet she still shines so brightly.

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:23.420
Master Nicol?

00:09:24.930 --> 00:09:26.170
Pardon me.

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:28.380
I see.

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:31.750
She has said she would like
to meet with you again,

00:09:32.270 --> 00:09:34.890
but if you don't feel
the same way, then so be it.

00:09:34.890 --> 00:09:36.420
I'm sorry.

00:09:36.730 --> 00:09:39.020
What now? Do you want to stop?

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:42.320
No, please arrange the next candidate.

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:44.020
All right.

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:45.760
Next time...

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:49.690
I need to properly face
whoever comes to see me.

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:12.300
Brother?

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:15.740
What's the matter?
Is something troubling you?

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:18.860
No, nothing in particular.

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:21.230
That's good, I suppose...

00:10:21.230 --> 00:10:24.170
Oh, right! You should read these!

00:10:24.170 --> 00:10:26.060
They'll make you feel much better!

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:27.810
"Conspiracy"...

00:10:28.070 --> 00:10:29.020
"Betrayal"...

00:10:29.360 --> 00:10:30.570
"Stolen"?

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:32.880
These aren't very calming words...

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:37.050
Stolen love is all the rage in
the world of romance novels right now!

00:10:37.050 --> 00:10:40.600
Two people stick with their love,
in defiance to customs and common knowledge!

00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:44.120
It'll give you courage
and make you feel optimistic!

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:46.120
Please give it a try!

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:48.010
O-Okay...

00:10:52.350 --> 00:10:56.400
Maybe I should just take her
and flee somewhere far away...

00:11:04.110 --> 00:11:06.400
My name is Frey Randall.

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:07.650
Pleased to meet you.

00:11:08.110 --> 00:11:09.890
I am Nicol Ascart.

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:13.460
Master Ascart...

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:14.060
Yes?

00:11:14.310 --> 00:11:18.080
I have no intention
of being betrothed to anyone.

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:21.950
I only came here today
because my parents insisted,

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:24.070
so you can relax.

00:11:24.440 --> 00:11:25.490
Relax?

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:26.550
Oh?

00:11:26.550 --> 00:11:30.000
Well, this isn't exactly
what you want, either, is it?

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.070
Huh?

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:33.890
Are you telling me you
didn't even realize it?

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:35.660
Uh...

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:39.690
I consider myself to be approaching
this meeting with enthusiasm.

00:11:39.690 --> 00:11:42.000
Women have surprisingly keen intuition.

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:44.010
We can almost always tell

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:47.440
whether the person we're talking
to is interested or not.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:49.820
I... see...

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:57.240
If I keep this up,
I'll never have a fiancée.

00:11:57.240 --> 00:11:59.650
What do you mean by that?

00:12:05.900 --> 00:12:08.490
Shall we take a little walk?

00:12:12.850 --> 00:12:14.910
There's someone I love,

00:12:14.910 --> 00:12:17.520
but she has a fiancé.

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:23.510
So I know I need to give up
and get engaged to someone else.

00:12:24.810 --> 00:12:28.200
I can't believe I'm saying all this
to someone I just met.

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:30.400
I could never tell anyone before...

00:12:30.400 --> 00:12:32.940
Do the two of them love each other?

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:36.160
Her fiancé does love her.

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:38.680
Then, how does she feel?

00:12:38.680 --> 00:12:41.480
Right now, I don't think she loves him yet.

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:46.240
Then, I don't see why you need to give up.

00:12:46.610 --> 00:12:49.900
If you can win her heart now—

00:12:49.900 --> 00:12:52.200
Her fiancé is a good friend of mine.

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:54.280
And if you think about it logically,

00:12:54.280 --> 00:12:56.910
it would be unthinkable
to take her from her fiancé.

00:13:02.030 --> 00:13:05.290
After all the people of all ages
and genders that you've fooled

00:13:05.290 --> 00:13:08.080
with that face and
the alluring aura you give off,

00:13:08.080 --> 00:13:10.170
hearing you talk about "logic"...

00:13:10.170 --> 00:13:11.800
You're just as the rumors say.

00:13:12.050 --> 00:13:15.680
Rumors? Did you hear about me from someone?

00:13:15.680 --> 00:13:17.400
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:22.540
The older students in the student
council often speak of you.

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:25.790
You're in the Magic
Academy's student council?

00:13:25.790 --> 00:13:26.650
Yes.

00:13:26.650 --> 00:13:29.880
I believe that was written
in the profile you were sent.

00:13:30.820 --> 00:13:33.790
You barely even looked at it, did you?

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:41.310
We did meet briefly
at the school festival, as well.

00:13:41.310 --> 00:13:45.900
I've always hoped
for a chance to talk to you.

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:49.640
I can't believe she's
on the student council!

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:53.850
That would mean she sees both
Geordo and Catarina there...

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:56.600
This is not good.

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:57.720
But...

00:13:57.720 --> 00:14:02.430
Lady Sophia didn't say anything
about your arranged marriage meetings.

00:14:02.430 --> 00:14:04.720
Does she not know?

00:14:04.720 --> 00:14:05.590
No.

00:14:05.590 --> 00:14:07.000
That makes sense.

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:09.370
She would put up
a terrible fight against it.

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:11.610
That's why I haven't told her...

00:14:11.610 --> 00:14:13.320
Wait, what makes you say that?

00:14:13.320 --> 00:14:19.800
Lady Sophia wants you
and Lady Catarina to end up together.

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:21.610
Sister of mine...

00:14:21.610 --> 00:14:25.560
Just how have you been behaving at school?

00:14:25.560 --> 00:14:28.250
I'll have to lecture her later.

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:34.580
Why did I tell her
that there's someone I love?!

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:37.660
I can't talk about Catarina any more!

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:38.600
Change it!

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:40.680
Change the subject!

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:46.760
Earlier, you said you have no
intention of being betrothed to anyone.

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:48.000
Why is that?

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:48.940
Because...

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:52.410
I want to live my life by my own strength.

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:54.530
Your own strength?

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:57.790
And that has something to do
with getting engaged?

00:14:57.790 --> 00:14:59.320
Of course it does.

00:14:59.320 --> 00:15:02.310
I don't want to live as the wife of a noble.

00:15:02.310 --> 00:15:05.710
I want to work outside
the house, like men do.

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:08.940
But my parents are opposed to that,

00:15:08.940 --> 00:15:11.910
and they've been rushing me to get married,

00:15:11.910 --> 00:15:14.780
which is why I came to this meeting.

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:17.430
I realize that it'll be difficult.

00:15:17.860 --> 00:15:19.640
Then why do you want to do it?

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:22.160
Because there's someone I look up to.

00:15:22.160 --> 00:15:23.840
She works at the Department of Magic,

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:26.350
and despite being a woman,
she stands at the top.

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:29.310
I want to be like her.

00:15:30.010 --> 00:15:32.320
A woman working at the Department of Magic?

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:34.040
Does she mean...

00:15:34.310 --> 00:15:39.840
It's impossible for a high-ranking noble lady
to work at the Department of Magic.

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:45.230
But I heard that Lady Catarina
was recently invited to work there.

00:15:45.230 --> 00:15:47.270
If that comes to pass,

00:15:47.270 --> 00:15:49.840
it will give me great hope.

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:52.570
But she's a special exception.

00:15:52.570 --> 00:15:55.640
It will most likely only last
until she gets married.

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:56.720
I know.

00:15:57.070 --> 00:16:01.480
But I don't want to give up...
I <i>can't</i> give up...

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:04.200
so I'm going to do everything I can.

00:16:06.090 --> 00:16:09.460
So why don't you also try not giving up

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:12.140
and taking a step toward the woman you love?

00:16:12.140 --> 00:16:15.870
If you don't do all you can,
you'll never know anything.

00:16:16.460 --> 00:16:22.670
Besides, Master Keith and Lady Mary
seem to have no intention of giving up.

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:27.460
It would be a shame if you were the only one
to give up because you felt you had to.

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:32.410
Does she actually know
that Catarina is the one I love?

00:16:33.900 --> 00:16:37.900
Besides, if you're not honest with yourself,

00:16:37.900 --> 00:16:40.590
I believe you'll regret it one day.

00:16:40.590 --> 00:16:43.310
Just don't lie to yourself.

00:16:57.580 --> 00:17:00.940
Above all, I would pity
the woman who gave her life to you

00:17:00.940 --> 00:17:05.210
when you've given your heart
to someone else.

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:14.000
You're right.

00:17:14.640 --> 00:17:19.940
I was only thinking about myself
and not about how she felt.

00:17:21.340 --> 00:17:23.690
You've made me realize that.

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:25.270
Thank you.

00:17:38.210 --> 00:17:40.180
Well, take care.

00:17:42.860 --> 00:17:43.870
Oh...

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:51.000
I really can't imagine Lady Catarina
sitting quietly on the throne at the palace.

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:53.210
That definitely wouldn't be her style.

00:18:06.910 --> 00:18:11.480
That Ginger Tucker has such
a terrible attitude, you know?

00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:14.600
She sure does. Who does she think she is?

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:18.320
She's just full of herself
because she's a little smart.

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:23.040
I don't think Ginger
is full of herself at all.

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:26.100
L-Lady Catarina! You're still here?

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:30.420
But Miss Tucker's attitude
toward you has been awful!

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:34.570
Doesn't she actually make
you feel angry deep down?

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:37.000
Not at all.

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:40.970
It's true that she can be
a little prickly at times,

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:43.850
but she's actually really sweet and kind!

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:47.350
And she's so caring, and sometimes
she gets all shy, and it's so cute!

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:48.720
She's a tsundere!

00:18:48.970 --> 00:18:50.610
Tsundere?

00:18:50.610 --> 00:18:53.600
Sweet? Kind?

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:55.240
Cute?

00:18:55.240 --> 00:18:57.990
Look at you, Ginger. You're blushing.

00:18:57.990 --> 00:19:00.440
Frey?! Wh-When did you...

00:19:02.180 --> 00:19:05.880
You really love Lady
Catarina, too, don't you?

00:19:07.280 --> 00:19:09.560
I'm never bored when I'm with you.

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:10.960
It's always fun.

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:12.160
Come on.

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:13.950
Let's go home.

00:19:17.150 --> 00:19:19.340
How did the meeting go?

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:23.640
I told today's candidate my honest feelings.

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:24.680
Huh?

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:29.370
About my dream of working
at the Department of Magic, like you.

00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:38.320
I hope we'll get to work at the Department
of Magic with Lady Catarina someday.

00:19:42.300 --> 00:19:44.360
I am truly sorry.

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:45.690
I understand.

00:19:45.690 --> 00:19:48.600
I'll reject all of your
arranged marriage offers.

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:51.870
You're still young, anyway.
There's no need to rush.

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:53.980
You're sure that's all right?

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:57.420
As a count's son, shouldn't
I get married as soon as possible?

00:19:57.420 --> 00:20:00.540
Don't worry so much about your
household in this day and age.

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:03.020
You're so serious, just like Radia.

00:20:07.610 --> 00:20:09.100
Brother!

00:20:11.150 --> 00:20:14.010
So that's what was going on.

00:20:14.010 --> 00:20:18.870
You know Father would never tell you
to marry for the family's sake.

00:20:18.870 --> 00:20:20.190
What do you mean?

00:20:20.190 --> 00:20:23.710
Well, Father fell in love
with Mother at first sight

00:20:23.710 --> 00:20:27.650
and stole her away
from the man she was engaged to!

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:31.240
Brother, did you not know about that?

00:20:31.240 --> 00:20:34.670
Wait a minute... You mean they, um...

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:36.620
He stole his bride.

00:20:36.620 --> 00:20:41.290
At the time, Mother's father,
our grandfather, was fiercely opposed.

00:20:41.290 --> 00:20:44.590
He said, "If you become the prime minister,
I'll give you my daughter,"

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:46.720
thinking it was an impossible challenge.

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:49.970
So Father worked desperately
to become the prime minister,

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:52.570
and Grandfather approved of their marriage.

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:55.270
I never knew...

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:59.180
If you ask Mother,
she'll gladly tell you all the details.

00:21:01.240 --> 00:21:04.960
I thought you knew everything, Brother,

00:21:04.960 --> 00:21:07.580
but it seems there are
many things you don't know.

00:21:07.580 --> 00:21:11.790
From now on, if there's anything
you don't know, just ask me!

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.000
What?!

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:18.250
You read romance novels, too?

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:19.120
Yes.

00:21:19.120 --> 00:21:20.810
Do you have any recommendations?

00:21:21.730 --> 00:21:23.710
I'm so happy to have another reading buddy!

00:21:23.710 --> 00:21:26.840
Um, let's see... What would be good?

00:21:26.840 --> 00:21:29.770
There's nothing that we <i>wouldn't</i> recommend!
